    "Condition : 5 - The extension hereby permitted shall only be used for a purpose ancillary to the business at the address 'Unit 9 Ground Floor And Part First Floor, Feltham Business Complex Browells Lane, TW13 7LW' described at the top of this decision letter and shall not be occupied as a separate commercial use (office or storage space).\r\n\r\nReason: To protect neighbour conditions, the character of the area and road safety\r\n"
